<title>PHILIPPINES: Universal six-mth net slightly up.</title>
<headline>Universal six-mth net slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   0.46 vs 0.44</p>
<p>    Net sales (billion)	    5.08 vs 4.23</p>
<p>    Net income		     681.51 vs 652.04</p>
<p>Note: Full name Universal Robina Corp. URC said it remained optimistic that revenues and operating income will improve in the second half of the fiscal year, which ends September, due to the continued strength of branded consumer foods, lower raw material costs particularly wheat and improved prices for sugar and poultry products.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
